OL,3,CProgramme listings for
OL,3,CProgramme listings for MON 15 JUN
OL,4,G0200FBrittany Howard live from 6 Music
OL,5,     FFestival
OL,6,     GAs part of the 6 Music Artist
OL,7,     GCollection, we revisit Brittany
OL,8,     GHoward's brilliant set, recorded
OL,9,     Glive at the Roundhouse in London
OL,10,     Gin March 2020 as part of the 6
OL,11,     GMusic Festival.
OL,12,G0300FShout Sister Shout
OL,13,     GRuby Turner celebrates the
OL,14,     Ginfluential gospel singer and
OL,15,     Gguitarist Sister Rosetta Tharpe.
OL,16,G0400FThe Brittany Howard Playlist
OL,17,     GCelebrating the music of Brittany
OL,18,     GHoward and its roots and
OL,19,     Gbranches, including influences
OL,20,     Gsuch as Sister Rosetta Tharpe,
OL,21,     GPrince, James Brown, Bjork, Nina
OL,22,     GSimone and Funkadelic.
